{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_adnach_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_adnach_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "預備“先知”",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_adnach_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "99fe21cb2ab4c48f36f769664a778d696f794d404aa8c4de52ccab5f50b77908",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "21_G3_victoria_street_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘗試克制的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_975_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，我們不想惹麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘗試克制的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_975_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島，我們治病的地方現在正在改建，我們只是來這個辦事處暫時生活一段時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘗試克制的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_975_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "辦事處的人和市政府達成了協議，我們會在未開發地塊上生活，不會和郡裡的人有交集。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘗試克制的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_975_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們不會打擾你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不會打擾？那麼這個傢伙是怎麼回事？他可是跑到了我家門口！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_974_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以前也是阿什福德郡的人，只是為了治病變賣了家產，離開了這裡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_974_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難得有一個機會能回來，我只是想看看我以前的家變成了什麼樣子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來就是你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我花了高價買了這套房子，然後才知道這套房子原來的主人是個倒楣的感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從那之後，我的人生就變得倒楣了起來！不僅如此，現在這棟房子還賣不出去！這一切都是你害的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也是這個郡的人？從你得了礦石病的那一刻起，你就已經不屬於這裡了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_974_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "居然還敢還手……我告訴你，這件事還沒結束！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郡警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼回事？為什麼聚集了這麼多人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘗試克制的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_975_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長官，我們——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郡警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們不是那群剛來的感染者嗎？不好好待在劃給你們的地塊上，居然偷偷溜進城裡來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長官，他們還動手了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_974_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……我只是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郡警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，我就說，把你們這些感染者放進來準沒好事。把這兩個人抓起來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，就該把他們都趕出去！誰知道他們是真的來借住，還是有別的企圖！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘗試克制的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_975_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，我們——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_974_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安德切爾先生——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽到你們的消息就趕過來了，沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘗試克制的病人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_975_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們沒事。但是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郡警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你又是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是負責護送這批病人來這裡的，羅德島行動預備組A4小組的隊員，安德切爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我對病人們的行為負責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郡警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "負責？怎麼負責？你們要是在這裡爆炸把我們炸死，誰來賠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島正在為了不讓這樣的事發生而努力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郡警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，努力有什麼用？別以為有大人物同意你們進城，你們就可以為所欲為了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郡警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我告訴你，有了今天這件事，明天就能讓你們全都滾出去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郡警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把他們全抓回去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cellroomA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郡警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "精金，你這個辦事處負責人現在不該出現在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郡警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也不該幫你開這個門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郡警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，看在你們羅德島幫我弟弟看過病的分上，你可以見他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德里和帕爾梅拉還好吧，有我這個“主犯”在，這裡的人應該不會太為難他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，多虧了你，他們還好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是……情況不太好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然在場的人有些能夠證明那場衝突是郡裡的那個年輕人挑起來的，但是沒有用，事情已經傳開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "郡裡本來就有不少人對於政府同意在未開發地塊上安置礦石病人的決定感到不滿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這場衝突還是落人口實了，我聽到一些風聲，有幾個貴族已經往市政廳去了，他們要重新討論該不該收容這批患者的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次在安排改建期間病人的去向上，原本就有讓病人們能夠儘量離家鄉近一點的意圖在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德里是這裡土生土長的人，為了治病變賣家產，吃了那麼多的苦才在羅德島安頓下來，他想要回自己過去的家看一看是人之常情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰說不是呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，我們也是花費了巨大的功夫，動用了辦事處建立以來的所有人脈，才讓一些大人物點頭，把這批患者安置在未開發地塊上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，如果這批患者現在要被趕走，那麻煩可就大了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，在這一帶有辦事處的三個郡裡，阿什福德郡已經是在政策上對感染者比較友好的一個郡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "另外兩個郡一開始就不同意幫羅德島安置患者，否則，我們也無需把病人集中過來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，如果他們要被遣返，恐怕只能繞更遠的路去其他地區的辦事處，病人們經不起這樣的消耗……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郡警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "精金，你該走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嘖，我是這裡的負責人，這件事的主要責任在我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會想辦法把你們撈出來，這件事後續我也會想辦法，有幾個在市政廳說得上話的貴族是可以想辦法的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，精金，我記得去年的時候，你寫信找我參謀副業的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還算是有些成果吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……都什麼時候了，你還有心情關心這個？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我有一個想法，需要你去找我的隊友們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽著，那批感染者不是現在正在未開發地塊待著嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們再找幾個人，我們等一下一起去找他們的麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上午的事情已經傳開了，現在郡裡的人都在看著他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們要做的，就是再添一把火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們……有必要做到這份上嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們是感染者，你難道想把那麼多不定時炸彈放在身邊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……不……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且你不明白嗎？我們現在這麼做，不管事情鬧成什麼樣，最後我們都會是其他人眼裡的英雄！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把感染者驅趕出去的英雄！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到時候，我們就可以靠這個名聲賺錢，不用再過現在這種被人看不起的日子！你也想過好日子，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就去多找幾個人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後再去找點武器來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們能不能當阿什福德郡的英雄，就看今天了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，總算讓我找到這個機會……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染者……算你們倒楣，你們就乖乖地成為我賺錢的跳板吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽著，我現在沒錢，但是我馬上就有錢了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高貴的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請問，是菲力浦先生嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……呃，女士，您找我有什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高貴的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是這樣的，我是在倫蒂尼姆做香料生意的商人，最近剛來到阿什福德郡做生意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高貴的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想為自己找一處住所，然後我看到了您的房子正在出售。請問您還願意出售嗎？我願意出高價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……您是認真的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高貴的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我現在——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高貴的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的時間很緊迫，希望您現在就能給我答覆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這……我明白了，您定個地方吧，我現在就來找您！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高貴的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那請您現在來市政廣場的咖啡廳吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，好的，我這就來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亢奮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天降橫財，天降橫財啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "菲力浦，我找到了幾個人——咦，人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cellroomA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個青年……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他的性格急躁，主動挑起了和患者之間的爭端，而且從穿著來看，經濟狀況並不好……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他極有可能成為直接引爆這個事件的導火索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但同時他也是最好解決的一個潛在威脅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許他對感染者沒有直接的惡意，只是想要藉機從爭端中獲利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而玫蘭莎家裡就是經商的，以她的氣質和談吐，假裝成一個對那個青年的房子感興趣的富商應該不難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要能把他的注意力從感染者上移開，短時間內他應該不會掀起新的風浪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這樣，這個潛在的危機應該已經消除了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，這只是個開始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下來才是麻煩的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bar_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要我說，就該把他們全趕出去！連同羅德島都一起趕出去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從一開始就反對讓這個羅德島在這裡開辦事處！我們就該和其他郡一樣，誰得了礦石病就把誰驅逐出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "猶豫的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那要是你得礦石病怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我平時吃好喝好，鍛煉身體，怎麼可能得礦石病？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要我說，今天發生的事情，就是遲早的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正我叔叔現在已經去市政廳了，我跟他說了，一定要說服其他貴族大人，把這群感染者從我們的家園趕出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "猶豫的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我認識羅德島的幾個醫生，他們人都很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那又怎麼樣？他們能治好礦石病嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "猶豫的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……唉，也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以說，我們這裡不需要感染者，也不需要治療感染者的醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的青年",
      "speakerId": "char_210_stward",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看未必。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有人幫感染者說話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的青年",
      "speakerId": "char_210_stward",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我並不是為感染者說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的青年",
      "speakerId": "char_210_stward",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是對這些感染者有一些別的看法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "猶豫的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "昏暗的燈光下，青年緊了緊衣領，拉了拉袖子，遮住了自己身上的源石結晶痕跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的青年",
      "speakerId": "char_210_stward",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這幾年，市政廳一直在說要對未開發地塊進行開發，但是出於各種原因，一直擱置著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的青年",
      "speakerId": "char_210_stward",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "理由有很多，但我想，無非是人力和財力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的青年",
      "speakerId": "char_210_stward",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "財力……我想，大人們都是有錢的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的青年",
      "speakerId": "char_210_stward",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "問題一直是出在人力上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "猶豫的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這……確實，我當工程師的叔叔說過，沒有公司願意接那個工作，吃力不討好，市政廳也很頭痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的青年",
      "speakerId": "char_210_stward",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們不需要感染者，那就把他們趕出去。那未開發地塊呢？我們也不需要一個沒用的地塊，是不是也丟出去就好了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放屁，那裡面有我交的稅！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "猶豫的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽起來你有辦法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的青年",
      "speakerId": "char_210_stward",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……為什麼不考慮把這些我們不需要的感染者和治療礦石病的製藥公司，隔離在未開發地塊上，讓他們幫我們開發新地塊呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cellroomA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想要說服民眾，我們的患者是無害的，是在羅德島的控制之下的……這是不可能的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "礦石病的性質導致了一旦它成為話題，大眾會天然地排斥它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在這種情況下，最直接且有效的做法，是拋出一個更大的話題，轉移群眾的注意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "史都華德說服他人的技巧是我見過的人裡數一數二的，有他出手，應該可以在一定程度上引導輿論的走向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少也應該能讓大眾有第三個選擇——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“反正都要處理這群感染者，不如把他們用得更好一些。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "進行這樣的思考真不好受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，這已經是我眼下能做出的最好的決策了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，輿論雖然能得到一定的控制，但是，這只是為了防止輿論最終倒逼貴族大人們做出決定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剩下的，也是最重要的一環，是貴族大人們最終的決定本身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一切全看你的了，卡緹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "數日後"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "子爵閣下，我們已經坐在這裡討論了好幾天了，今天也該有一個結果了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是一個該不該把這批感染者趕出去的問題，已經浪費了我至少三場演出的票了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻薄的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，一開始就是你這傢伙建議讓羅德島在本郡建立的辦事處，這批病人的安置也是你說服子爵閣下的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻薄的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼現在反倒高高掛起了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，我這個人，心中從來只有本郡的利益。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島是一家大有前途的製藥公司，和他們合作沒有壞處，這兩年，本郡的醫療水準難道沒有提高嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於這批病人，反正未開發地塊放著也是放著，賣羅德島一個人情，他們早晚會回報我們的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真要說起來，也不知道是哪個一直嚷嚷著要開發新地塊的人，這幾年卻一直沒有動靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果它真的有用，我又怎麼會同意拿來安置病人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻薄的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你！現在有些人在下面煽風點火，拿新地塊當藉口，要把這批病人隔離在新地塊上協助開發，是不是就是你搞的鬼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵，我說我沒有，您信嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻薄的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……哼，無論你到底在盤算什麼，我可以明白地告訴你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻薄的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "光靠這群病人，他們是不可能勝任新地塊的開發工作的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你我說什麼都不算，最終，還是要看子爵閣下的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的子爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魯弗斯，關於羅德島，之前我聽了你的建議，事實證明，你是對的，他們確實為本郡帶來了不容小覷的收益。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的子爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽到了民眾之中有一種聲音，同意他們留在新地塊上，但代價是要幫助我們開發新地塊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的子爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但這種想法並不現實。這些病人……他們又能做到什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我，好的……我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請他們進來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您說得對，我親愛的子爵閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但如果我說，參與新地塊開發的，不只病人們呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "子爵閣下，久疏問候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的子爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "精金？你現在來見我已經晚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……您見過我帶來的人之後，或許會改變想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……呼，總算是趕上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安德切爾這傢伙，居然要我在這麼短的時間裡跑到最近的兩個辦事處去搬救兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快把我累死了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_212_ansel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣的事，我們之中也只有腳程最快的你能做到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_212_ansel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，從其他辦事處增援的力度來看，他們都同意了安德切爾的計劃，是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒辦法，誰讓大家都相信我們的大先知呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，要我說啊，大家只是沒有發現他善良表皮下藏著的邪惡內心而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_212_ansel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "據我所知，他只是偶爾會騙你幫他買單吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這還不夠邪惡嗎？！反正，這次他至少得請我吃一個星期的飯才行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到時候，我就專挑最貴的吃，狠狠地剝削他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_212_ansel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，這下他的錢包可要大出血了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，讓他知道，使喚我也是有代價的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，抱歉抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "子爵閣下，您好，我是羅德島行動預備組A4小組的隊員，卡緹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這兩位分別是羅德島駐多爾瓦郡辦事處的負責人，和羅德島駐哈弗利郡辦事處的負責人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的子爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們是隔壁兩郡的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島知道阿什福德郡一直有在新地塊上增蓋一所醫院的想法，但是，本地辦事處的醫療資源不足以提供這樣的協助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以這一次，我們藉著這個機會，和周邊辦事處的負責人們討論了一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們同意為阿什福德郡辦事處增派醫療資源和人力，協助新醫院的建設。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在，人手和資源都已經準備就緒了，不知道您意下如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cellroomA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在這麼短的時間內前往周邊兩郡，請當地辦事處的負責人支援，只有卡緹的腳程能做得到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看到這一切，那位子爵必然不會高興，她能猜到有人在背後操控這一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但她會接受，因為這對她、對阿什福德郡百利而無一害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是我向博士學到的，把所有的資訊交織在一起，最終拿出的，往往是一個對方即使能理解，也依然會跳入的陽謀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "推演到這一步應該就可以了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這已經是現在的我能做到的極限了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剩下的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安德切爾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們再不來救我，我恐怕就要因為恐懼在這裡死掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "史都華德",
      "speakerId": "char_210_stward",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別裝了，安德切爾，你的氣色可不像是一個絕望的囚犯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，安德切爾，你記住，你要請我吃一個星期的飯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，這趟跑腿值這麼多嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然！而且玫蘭莎已經批准了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玫蘭莎",
      "speakerId": "char_208_melan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，安德切爾，這次你逃不了的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，當年那個天真純潔的卡緹究竟到哪裡去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是指被你說兩句就繞進去了然後乖乖幫你付飯錢的笨蛋卡緹嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "託某位先知這幾年的鍛煉，我現在可沒那麼好騙了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來，一切都解決了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_212_ansel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "患者們現在已經進城並安頓好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_212_ansel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "子爵同意和羅德島一起在未開發地塊上建造醫院，現在正在商討分工的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_212_ansel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一切都如同你希望的那樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……呼，那就好。大家都辛苦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_212_ansel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我算是最輕鬆的，只需要照顧病人就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最輕鬆的應該是我，我只是坐在這裡，等你們的結果而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安德切爾，你知道嗎，你現在謙虛的樣子，有點博士的味道哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……當我真正嘗試像博士一樣去運籌帷幄的時候，我才意識到，我和博士之間的距離。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們所面臨的東西和肩上的責任完全不是同一個等級的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我很慶幸我跨出了這一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，既然事情解決了，我們去吃飯吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉特蘭信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安德切爾先生在嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉特蘭信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我帶來了聖城的消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安德切爾，這是怎麼一回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，卡緹，欠你的飯，看來要過段時間才能還你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隊長，這裡的事情既然已經告一段落，我申請離隊一段時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玫蘭莎",
      "speakerId": "char_208_melan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你終於下定了決心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "21_G3_victoria_street_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉特蘭信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是蕾繆安樞機的信件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉特蘭信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第七廳同意了你返回拉特蘭的申請，並希望你能先到達聖城外圍，會有人在那裡見你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉特蘭信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_365_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我將為你引路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "史都華德",
      "speakerId": "char_210_stward",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以下次見到你，你會帶上你的銃嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "銃並不重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說過，所謂的“先知”能力，並不意味著我是被選擇的，或者我是被期待的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是偶爾會出現像我一樣的薩科塔，我們在思維方式上會和普通薩科塔有些差別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們必須同意成為教皇廳的一員，接受教皇廳的管束，才可以獲得持銃的權利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是選擇了放棄這項權利，離開拉特蘭外出遊歷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而這次回去，我也不是為了重新獲得這項權利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家還記得行動預備組是為什麼而存在的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然啦，和精英幹員一樣，只有認同羅德島的理念，願意投身於羅德島事業的幹員才能加入。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "許多人好奇我們為什麼甘願當這麼久的行動預備組，但我們自己知道，我們並不在乎那些虛名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們在乎的，是如何幫助感染者，如何消除礦石病對這片大地的影響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是我一開始加入羅德島時的選擇……也是我迄今為止，從未後悔過的一個選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這次回去，更多是想要瞭解，這片大地上正在發生什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後，我就會回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "史都華德",
      "speakerId": "char_210_stward",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "史都華德",
      "speakerId": "char_210_stward",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是有些感慨，認識你這麼久，我第一次看到你這麼認真地說這些話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，有點不適應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玫蘭莎",
      "speakerId": "char_208_melan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有點肉麻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_212_ansel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還蠻帥的喔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……別說了，我開始後悔剛才說那些話了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡緹",
      "speakerId": "char_209_ardign",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，聖城應該有許多新式甜點吧，回來的時候，記得幫我們帶一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我就先走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "安德切爾向夥伴們揮手告別後，轉身向信使示意，兩人一起踏上了前往拉特蘭的旅途。\n他沒有回頭。\n卡緹等人的臉上也沒有離別的憂愁。\n他們知道，離別只是暫時的，有更緊密的東西將他們連在一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
